  "description": "Fixture for the Feature queries panel option (issue #65). Three queries: A = measurements, B and C = reference series carrying the spec limits. The two panels are identical except for featureQueryRefIds - left leaves it empty, right declares B and C as feature queries. Only the right panel's statistics table describes the process alone.",
